# Overdue in one pane and Logbook in another come back after a restart, with the Logbook pane focused.
file <<END
- Late @due({today-2})
- Finished @done({today-1})
END
keys gO <C-w> s gL
see │  󱓳 Logbook
restart
see 󰨱 Overdue
see │  󱓳 Logbook
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Late @due({today-2})
- Finished
END
